Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:02.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Want a diary that talks back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.17,0:00:05.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Want a diary that knows you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:08.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Well, now you have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:13.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Smart Goal Tracker\Nisn’t just a calendar.\NIt works with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:20.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,It knows about you and constantly updates\Nits understanding of who you are\Nand what you are trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:28.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,It remembers what you have said,\Nknows how you have grown,\Nand knows how you can optimize yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.51,0:00:34.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Take the Interactive Diary.\NYou write in your diary—\Nand it writes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it’s smart because it knows you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:40.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Smart Goal Tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,How can we make your life easier?
